	(text "BOOT0 = PA14 (shared with SWCLK).\nHold BOOT, tap RESET -> USB DFU bootloader.\nA blank chip starts in DFU on its own. If BOOT\nis ignored later, clear nBOOT_SEL once (CubeProgrammer)."
