	(text "Motor current limit: \nITRIP = VREF / (1000uA/A x R16)\nPA4 (TIM14) PWM ~100kHz, VREF max 3.0V -> 1.1A\n\nUSB source current (CC_SENSE = Vcc/2):\n<0.33V default, 0.35-0.58V 1.5A, 0.66-1.02V 3A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 253.746 225.806 0)
